changelog: v1 PAS rudiment #11 — 'six stroke roll' worked through the kit. Bars 1-3 play the rudiment as a sextuplet on every beat (sticking RLLRRL with accents on the first and last strokes). Bar 4 voices the same sticking across snare and toms for a one-bar fill

